    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Orgs where SBQQ__GeneralSettings__c shows a custom QCP is active.
Why it matters: Informational — QCP customizes calculation logic and can mask or amplify other detectors. Admins need to know one is active to investigate calc anomalies.
Suppress a finding: always acceptable; this is a signal, not a defect.
Disable the detector: appropriate if QCP usage is documented and stable. Most should leave on for visibility.</value></values>
